@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

state RegisterLogin <<choice>>
state TeacherChoice <<choice>>
state StudentChoice <<choice>>

[*] --> RegisterLogin

RegisterLogin --> LoginDetails : register or log in with details
LoginDetails --> ContinueAs : continue as a teacher or student

TeacherChoice --> CreateQuiz : create a new quiz
TeacherChoice --> EditQuiz : edit an existing quiz
CreateQuiz --> SaveDraftOrPost : save as draft or post for students
SaveDraftOrPost --> ViewResults : view quiz results once over

StudentChoice --> SelectQuiz : select a quiz after notification
SelectQuiz --> AnswerQuiz : answer the selected quiz
AnswerQuiz --> SubmitQuiz : submit their quiz
SubmitQuiz --> ViewResult : view result after submitting

@enduml
